{"id": 7, "ts": 1792519040.3264868, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I appreciate Anna\u2019s focus on Candidate\u202fC\u2019s decision speed and reliability, but the pilot\u2011assessment feedback highlights a serious CRM concern: C\u2019s difficulty communicating ideas and egocentric attitude can erode shared situational awareness and discourage crew input, which are critical on long\u2011distance flights. While he does make quick correct decisions and is said to foster a positive atmosphere, the communication gaps could undermine safety if not mitigated. Compared with the other candidates, B shows strong reliability and stress resilience, and D demonstrates excellent problem\u2011solving and responsibility, yet both also have crew\u2011interaction issues. Given the weight of CRM for safety, I remain cautious about C and would prefer a candidate whose communication and teamwork are demonstrably solid. Therefore, I am shifting my provisional recommendation to **Candidate\u202fB**, whose conscientiousness, stress handling, and technical competence give a more balanced profile, and whose communication shortcomings appear less likely to impair CRM than C\u2019s."}
